ork, Scott has also conducted a trial examining the costs and consequences associated with systematic nutrition team follow-up after percutaneous endoscopic gastrostomy. Through these efforts, Scott contributes to advancing knowledge and improving patient care in both osteoporosis management and nutritional support in clinical settings.", "FASANO:", "ANA Mª MÁRQUEZ ARMENTEROS:Ana Mª Márquez Armenteros is a specialist in pediatric gastroenterology at Hospital Materno Infantil, focusing on the diagnosis and follow-up of metabolic disorders.", "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO INFANTA CRISTINA:Hospital Universitario Infanta Cristina is a healthcare institution in Badajoz, specializing in clinical nutrition and dietetics.", "HOSPITAL MATERNO INFANTIL:Hospital Materno Infantil is a medical facility in Badajoz that specializes in pediatric care and the diagnosis of metabolic disorders.", "UNIVERSIDAD DE EXTREMADURA:Universidad de Extremadura is an educational institution in Badajoz, focusing on biomedical sciences and medical education.", "HOMOCISTINURIA:Homocystinuria is a metabolic disorder resulting from a deficiency in cystathionine beta-synthase, leading to the accumulation of homocysteine.", "ENFERMEDAD DE ORINA DE JARABE DE ARCE:The \"ENFERMEDAD DE ORINA DE JARABE DE ARCE,\" known as Maple Syrup Urine Disease (MSUD), is an amino acid metabolism disorder. It is characterized by a deficiency in the branched-chain alpha-keto acid dehydrogenase complex. This deficiency results in the accumulation of specific amino acids in the body, which can lead to various health complications.", "ERRORRES INNATOS DEL CICLO DE LA UREA:Urea cycle disorders are genetic conditions that result in a deficiency of one of the enzymes in the urea cycle, leading to the accumulation of ammonia in the body."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}